{"slug":"acute-kidney-injury","title":"急性腎損傷（急性腎衰竭）","subtitle":"Acute kidney injury(AKI), formerly acute renal failure(ARF)","category":"disease","aliases":["急性腎損傷","AKI","Acute kidney injury","急性腎衰竭","ARF","Acute renal failure","腎前性","腎性","腎後性","Prerenal","Intrarenal","Postrenal","急性腎小管壞死","ATN","急性腎小管傷害","急性間質性腎炎","少尿期","利尿期","恢復期","初始期","少尿型","非少尿型","KDIGO 分期","顯影劑腎病變","橫紋肌溶解","肌紅素尿","腎毒性藥物","尿毒症候群"],"dzTags":["急性腎衰竭","急性腎小管壞死","急性間質性腎炎","寡尿","無尿","腎衰竭"],"admTags":[],"system":"renal","alsoIn":["critical-care"],"group":"kidney-diseases","reviewed":false,"updated":"2026-10-21","references":[{"title":"華杏《內外科護理學》下冊，第 19 章，腎衰竭：急性腎損傷(書頁 808–813)","note":"病程分期、原因表與處置依此書；本頁文字與表格為重新整理撰寫"},{"title":"KDIGO Clinical Practice Guideline for Acute Kidney Injury(Kidney Int Suppl 2012;2:1–138)","url":"https://kdigo.org/guidelines/acute-kidney-injury/","note":"診斷與分期；2026 AKI／AKD 新版仍為草案(2026-10-21 查)"},{"title":"華杏《兒科護理學》，腎衰竭：急性腎損傷(書頁 610–612)","note":"兒童少尿定義與補液依此書"},{"title":"The ICU Book 5th ed.(Marino 2025)，Ch34 Acute Kidney Injury","note":"肌酸酐的限制、腎臟替代療法；僅作為撰寫參考"}],"chapters":["內外-Ch10腎臟與泌尿系統疾病 > 腎臟疾病 > 急性腎損傷與慢性腎臟病","病理-Ch14泌尿系統疾病 > 腎臟疾病","兒科-Ch12兒童泌尿生殖系統疾病 > 常見泌尿生殖系統疾病及其護理"],"intro":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"p","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"急性腎損傷"}]},{"type":"text","value":"(AKI, acute kidney injury)是腎功能在短時間內突然下降，含氮廢物（BUN，blood urea nitrogen、肌酸酐）排不出去，水分、電解質與酸鹼跟著失衡。2002 年起醫界把「急性腎衰竭」改稱急性腎損傷，把輕度的腎功能下降也納入，因為即使輕微也會影響預後（《內外科護理學》下冊 p.809）。及早找到原因多半可以恢復；腎功能檢驗見 "},{"type":"element","tagName":"k-link","properties":{"target":"renal-function-tests"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"腎功能檢驗：BUN、肌酸酐、清除率與 eGFR"}]},{"type":"text","value":"，高血鉀處理見 "},{"type":"element","tagName":"k-link","properties":{"target":"potassium#hyperkalemia-treatment"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"高血鉀的緊急處理"}]}]}]},"sections":[{"id":"summary","depth":2,"number":"一、","title":"重點摘要","children":[{"id":"exam-points","depth":3,"number":"(一)","title":"國考常考點","children":[],"content":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"ul","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"嚴重燒傷、心肌梗塞、敗血性休克是"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"腎前性"}]},{"type":"text","value":"；"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"SLE 是腎性"}]}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"腎前性檢驗：BUN/Cr > 20"},{"type":"text","value":":1"},{"type":"text","value":"、尿比重 > 1.015、尿滲透壓 500 以上；「"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"尿鈉 > 40 mEq/L"}]},{"type":"text","value":"」是腎性才有（錯誤選項）"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"24 小時尿量 300–350 mL → "},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"少尿期"}]},{"type":"text","value":"、少尿型 AKI；高血鉀心電圖是 "},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"T 波高尖"}]},{"type":"text","value":"（不是低而寬）；AKI 腎臟"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"不會變小"}]},{"type":"text","value":"（變小是慢性）；攝護腺肥大造成的是"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"腎後性"}]}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"少尿期生化：肌酸酐、BUN、鉀"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"上升"}]},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"血磷上升"}]},{"type":"text","value":"（不是下降）"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"燒傷初期大量肌紅素 → "},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"急性腎小管壞死"}]},{"type":"text","value":"；燒傷初期 GFR(glomerular filtration rate) "},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"下降"}]},{"type":"text","value":"（不是增加）"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"急性腎小管傷害是"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"腎小管"}]},{"type":"text","value":"上皮壞死，病理"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"不是"}]},{"type":"text","value":"絲球體壞死；可造成少尿（< 400 mL/天），缺血、重金屬、有機溶劑都是原因"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"急性間質性腎炎：藥物（抗生素）過敏，停藥後腎功能多可恢復，"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"不需要長期透析"}]}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"少尿期護理："},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"限制水分"}]},{"type":"text","value":"、"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"限制高鈉高磷"}]},{"type":"text","value":"、高熱量低蛋白、"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"不可"}]},{"type":"text","value":"高鉀飲食；Kayexalate 是讓鉀"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"從腸道排出"}]}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"計算：尿量 360 mL ＋ 嘔吐 150 mL ＋ 無感性約 500 mL ≈ 1,000 mL；只給 510 mL 是錯的"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"急性腎衰竭的酸鹼："},{"type":"element","tagName"