腎炎"}]},{"type":"text","value":"（藥物過敏）"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"腎後性"}]},{"type":"text","value":"：尿路阻塞 → 結石、"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"攝護腺肥大"}]},{"type":"text","value":"、腫瘤、血塊"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"病程四期："},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"初始期 → 少尿期 → 利尿期 → 恢復期"}]}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"少尿期"}]},{"type":"text","value":"（< 400 mL/天，約 1–8 週）："},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"高血鉀"}]},{"type":"text","value":"、低血鈉、高血磷低血鈣、高血鎂、"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"代謝性酸中毒"}]},{"type":"text","value":"、體液過多（水腫、肺水腫、高血壓）、尿毒症狀、貧血與出血傾向"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"利尿期"}]},{"type":"text","value":"（每天 1–5 L，約 10–14 天）：腎小管還不會回收 → "},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"脫水、低血鉀、低血鈉"}]},{"type":"text","value":"；BUN 與肌酸酐一開始仍高"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"腎前性 vs 腎性：腎前性 "},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"BUN/Cr > 20"}]},{"type":"text","value":"、尿鈉 "},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"< 20"}]},{"type